    description: "OpenClaw AI Agent (SOUL.md) skill OpenClaw SOUL.md OpenClaw Agent OpenClaw NPC lobster soullobster character SOULgacha Use when creating, designing, or customizing an OpenClaw lobster persona - identity, SOUL.md, name, or avatar prompt.",
